+/* OpenMCX, 2026-10-25: TS 33.203 V19.1.0 clause 7.1 rule 1, the SA_table holds the IMPI of each SA: the new set
+ * belongs to the private user identity of the REGISTER it answers until its SAs are deleted (its SPI pair released).
